ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/match1869165date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两度扳平！日本绝平2-2荷兰 镰田大地被动破门范戴克世界杯首球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260615/zhanbao_image_1869165_1781474020_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260615/zhanbao_image_1869165_1781474020_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260615/zhanbao_image_1869165_1781474020_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">镰田大地被动头球绝平，最终荷兰2-2日本。荷兰的下一个对手是瑞典，日本将面对突尼斯。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/match1869158date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">惨案！德国7-1库拉索 德国6人破门哈弗茨双响翁达夫替补1射2传</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260615/zhanbao_image_1869158_1781463254_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260615/zhanbao_image_1869158_1781463254_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260615/zhanbao_image_1869158_1781463254_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>德国7-1大胜库拉索取得开门红，德国下轮将迎战科特迪瓦，库拉索将对阵厄瓜多尔。</p><p><strong>【世界杯相关】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2ee3672f1b0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创造历史！科梅嫩夏攻破德国大门，库拉索收获世界杯历史首球！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2ee96e8b1d3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2ee96e8b1d3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2ee96e8b1d3.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯德国vs库拉索，第21分钟，利瓦诺·科梅嫩夏破门，打入库拉索世界杯历史首球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2f20851835enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">继续不败！日本2-2绝平荷兰，亚足联球队本届2胜2平仍保持不败！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2f1d1e8ebcd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2f1d1e8ebcd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2f1d1e8ebcd.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">美加墨世界杯小组赛F组第1轮，镰田大地第89分钟绝平，日本队2-2战平荷兰，本届世界杯上亚足联球队继续保持不败。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2f261895ce3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">绝平荷兰仍不满足！森保一：没能取胜令人遗憾，球员始终没有放弃</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150549475480.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150549475480.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150549475480.jpg"> </div><p>日本队两度落后两度扳平，2-2战平荷兰。赛后日本队主帅森保一接受了采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2f0d5b771a9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">1-7德国！库拉索主帅：输1-4我还能接受，但这个比分实在太过分了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2ef0802f5fd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2ef0802f5fd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2ef0802f5fd.jpg"> </div><p>库拉索队78岁主帅艾德沃卡特接受荷兰国家公共广播电视台采访，回顾了库拉索队史首场世界杯比赛的这场失利。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2ef9e511697native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">超越五星巴西！德国队已在世界杯打入239球，登顶赛事总进球榜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150259054396.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150259054396_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150259054396_720.jpg"> </div><p>德国vs库拉索，比赛在尾声阶段来到7-1。squawka数据统计显示，德国队在世界杯的总进球数已经来到239球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2ef8aad6f15native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴西球迷关电视了！德国7-1狂胜库拉索，14年世界杯曾7-1巴西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.99" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150254241894.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.99" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.99" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150254241894.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150254241894.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛E组第1轮，德国7-1大胜库拉索。此前2014年世界杯，德国半决赛7-1狂胜东道主巴西。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2f0679a7c72native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">令人动容！库拉索首次参加世界杯，78岁老帅艾德沃卡特热泪盈眶</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150354098984_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150354098984_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150354098984_1280.jpg"> </div><p>在对阵德国队的比赛前，面对这一历史时刻，艾德沃卡特热泪盈眶；在库拉索取得队史世界杯首粒进球后，艾德沃卡特振臂高呼，令人动容。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2f131898397native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">离首战不到1天！因国际足联没提供许可，乌拉圭航班被推迟4个小时</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150446491646_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150446491646_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/202606150446491646_1280.jpg"> </div><p>沙特vs乌拉圭的比赛将在6月16日6点进行，但由于国际足联的工作失误，乌拉圭队没能准时飞往美国。</p><p><strong>【皇马HWG库库雷利亚】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-14/6a2ece2808d86native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺独家：皇马将签库库雷利亚，转会费超5000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260614/202606142352431977_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260614/202606142352431977_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260614/202606142352431977_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的 “Here We Go”确认，皇马将签下切尔西左后卫库库雷利亚，转会费超5000万欧！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2ed577ede32native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">魅力！罗马诺：库库原计划世界杯后决定未来，皇马报价后立即同意</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220818/62fe36672bb17.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220818/62fe36672bb17.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220818/62fe36672bb17.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺表示，库库原计划世界杯后决定未来，皇马报价后他立即同意。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-15/6a2f12047fa2bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官宣倒计时！罗马诺：库库雷利亚将在周一成为皇马球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220818/62fe369ec1297.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220818/62fe369ec1297.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220818/62fe369ec1297.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺消息，库